# Guitar (issue 050, option 3 from Marc's diagonal concept): 1x1 tile, seen from above and the side at once. The neck runs up and to the west to a headstock with tuners, the body sits low and to the east with a waist, a dark sound hole and a shaded side. Hangs on the west wall like the old one.
